  "description": {
    "zh": "<p>非遞增序列包含學生的身高。给定新学生的身高，輸出从 1 开始的位置，在该位置之后应插入该学生。 </p><p><strong>Java 注意：</strong> 本章以陣列或 ArrayList 儲存資料；大小固定時優先使用陣列，需要插入或刪除時使用 ArrayList。</p>",
    "en": "<p>A non-increasing sequence contains students' heights. Given a new student's height, print the 1-based position after which the student should be inserted.</p><p><strong>Java note:</strong> Use arrays for fixed-size data and ArrayList when insertion or removal is required.</p>"
  },
  "hint": {
